{"type":"message","id":"a17a4eae","parentId":"1768c43a","timestamp":"2026-03-04T07:28:44.596Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 15:28 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## 任务: ParMETIS 算法能力边界测试\n\n### 测试目标\n验证 ParMETIS 在极端配置下的正确性：少量进程剖分大量块\n\n### 测试矩阵\n\n| Test | n_mpi | np (n_mesh) | 比例 | 说明 |\n|------|-------|-------------|------|------|\n| 1 | 2 | 8 | 1:4 | 2进程剖分8块 |\n| 2 | 2 | 16 | 1:8 | 2进程剖分16块 |\n| 3 | 4 | 16 | 1:4 | 4进程剖分16块 |\n| 4 | 5 | 20 | 1:4 | 5进程剖分20块 |\n| 5 | 2 | 20 | 1:10 | 2进程剖分20块 |\n\n### 测试步骤\n\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\nsource ../env.sh\nexport PATH=$MPI_ROOT/bin:$PATH\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$CGNS_ROOT/lib:$METIS_ROOT/lib:$PARMETIS_ROOT/lib:$MPI_ROOT/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n\n# Test 1: n_mpi=2, np=8\nrm -f decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\nmpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 8\nmpirun -n 8 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# Test 2: n_mpi=2, np=16\nrm -f decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\nmpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 16\nmpirun -n 16 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# Test 3: n_mpi=4, np=16\nrm -f decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\nmpirun -n 4 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 16\nmpirun -n 16 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# Test 4: n_mpi=5, np=20\nrm -f decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\nmpirun -n 5 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 20\nmpirun -n 20 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# Test 5: n_mpi=2, np=20\nrm -f decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\nmpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 20\nmpirun -n 20 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n```\n\n### 验证标准\n1. 剖分成功：生成 np 个 `decomposed_mesh_*.cgns` 文件\n2. 文件均衡：每个文件大小相近（单元数差异 < 10%）\n3. CFD 模拟收敛：残差 < 1e-6\n\n### 输出要求\n记录每个测试：\n- 剖分耗时\n- 生成的文件数和每个文件的单元数\n- CFD 模拟耗时和最终残差\n- 是否收敛\n\n### 如果发现问题\n直接调用 code-agent 进行修复，记录问题详情。"}],"timestamp":1772609324594}}
