{"type":"message","id":"f7c0cb0b","parentId":"ff191945","timestamp":"2026-03-04T07:38:23.787Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The CFD simulation is running. It looks like the residuals are decreasing. Let me continue to wait for the process to complete. But I notice the time - each iteration is taking about 30 seconds, and there are 200 iterations maximum. This could take a very long time. \n\nLet me check the test requirements again - the convergence criteria is residual < 1e-6. Looking at the current progress:\n- Iteration 5: pressurecorrectionEquation residual = 0.245152\n\nThis is decreasing but still quite high. The simulation for np=16 will likely take a very long time. Let me wait a bit more to see the pattern.\n\nActually, looking at Test 1 (np=8), it converged within 148 iterations and took about 17 seconds total. The np=16 case seems to be taking much longer per iteration (about 30 seconds vs about 10 ms per iteration for np=8). This is strange - maybe there's something wrong with the parallel decomposition.\n\nActually wait, I see \"Time elapsed = 115 seconds\" - that's cumulative time for each process, not per iteration. So the simulation is actually progressing, just slowly. Let me continue waiting.\n\nBut this is taking a very long time. Let me just continue polling to see if it completes.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"进程运行时间很长。让我继续等待完成："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-5ad829aea29043dea1c6e5b3fb6104b1","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"poll","sessionId":"clear-forest","timeout":600000}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":41183,"output":570,"cacheRead":6015,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47768,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772609883003}}
